---

<section id="timeline" class="py-20 border-b border-zinc-800">
  <div class="mb-12">
    <h2 class="text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-zinc-100 mb-4">Background Accademico</h2>
    <p class="text-zinc-400">Percorso formativo e core curriculum.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="space-y-0">
    
    <!-- Tor Vergata -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-12 border-t border-zinc-800">
      <div class="md:col-span-3 py-6 md:py-8 font-mono text-sm text-zinc-500">
        In corso (Prevista: 2027)
      </div>
      <div class="md:col-span-9 py-6 md:py-8 md:pl-8 border-t border-zinc-800 md:border-t-0 md:border-l">
        <h3 class="text-xl font-medium text-zinc-100 mb-1">Ingegneria Informatica (Laurea Triennale)</h3>
        <h4 class="text-sm font-mono text-emerald-500 mb-4 uppercase tracking-wider">Università degli Studi di Roma Tor Vergata</h4>
        
        <p class="text-zinc-400 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-6">
          Indirizzo: <strong>Sistemi Software e Web</strong>. Il percorso focalizza lo studio sull'analisi algoritmica, l'architettura dei sistemi e la progettazione formale delle basi di dati.
        </p>
        
        <div>
          <h5 class="text-xs font-mono text-zinc-500 uppercase tracking-wider mb-3">[ Moduli Formativi Principali ]</h5>
          <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-x-4 gap-y-2">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-zinc-300">
              <span class="text-emerald-500 font-mono">></span> Ingegneria del Software
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-zinc-300">
              <span class="text-emerald-500 font-mono">></span> Basi di Dati
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-zinc-300">
              <span class="text-emerald-500 font-mono">></span> Sistemi Operativi
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-zinc-300">
              <span class="text-emerald-500 font-mono">></span> Reti & Ingegneria del Web
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-zinc-300">
              <span class="text-emerald-500 font-mono">></span> Algoritmi e Strutture Dati
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-zinc-300">
              <span class="text-emerald-500 font-mono">></span> Ricerca Operativa
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    
    <!-- Liceo -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-12 border-t border-zinc-800">
      <div class="md:col-span-3 py-6 md:py-8 font-mono text-sm text-zinc-500">
        Diploma
      </div>
      <div class="md:col-span-9 py-6 md:py-8 md:pl-8 border-t border-zinc-800 md:border-t-0 md:border-l">
        <h3 class="text-xl font-medium text-zinc-100 mb-1">Liceo Scientifico</h3>
        <h4 class="text-sm font-mono text-zinc-500 uppercase tracking-wider">Guglielmo Marconi</h4>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>
